meta {
  name: Get Form
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/clients/{{clientId}}/forms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Everything Sol Gate needs to process a submission: the form (payloadSchema,
  allowedOrigins), its integrations (with fieldMapping) and its notification
  channels (template, subject, includeFields, message, integrationIds — the
  integrations each notification reports on; opt-in, so empty means none).
  Client-scoped: a form id under another client is a 404. Never includes
  credentials.
}
